WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the existing Japanese guide slideshow.
Timing follows scripts/build-videos.py at 24 fps (62 frames per guide slide).

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hands-free capture with Siri and AirPods.
Japanese in-app guide screenshots.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.583
From AirPods to your inbox and Obsidian.

00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:08.167
Japanese phrase: “シンプルメモで残す”
